OpenBLAS 0.3.32 omits the DOUBLE PRECISION declaration of DROUNDUP_LWORK
in DSYGVD and DSPGVD, so an LWORK=-1 query stores WORK(1)=0.
Backport of https://github.com/OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS/pull/5753

--- a/lapack-netlib/SRC/dspgvd.f
+++ b/lapack-netlib/SRC/dspgvd.f
@@ -225,7 +225,8 @@
 *     ..
 *     .. External Functions ..
       LOGICAL            LSAME
-      EXTERNAL           LSAME
+      DOUBLE PRECISION   DROUNDUP_LWORK
+      EXTERNAL           LSAME, DROUNDUP_LWORK
 *     ..
 *     .. External Subroutines ..
       EXTERNAL           DPPTRF, DSPEVD, DSPGST, DTPMV, DTPSV, XERBLA
--- a/lapack-netlib/SRC/dsygvd.f
+++ b/lapack-netlib/SRC/dsygvd.f
@@ -245,7 +245,8 @@
 *     ..
 *     .. External Functions ..
       LOGICAL            LSAME
-      EXTERNAL           LSAME
+      DOUBLE PRECISION   DROUNDUP_LWORK
+      EXTERNAL           LSAME, DROUNDUP_LWORK
 *     ..
 *     .. External Subroutines ..
       EXTERNAL           DPOTRF, DSYEVD, DSYGST, DTRMM, DTRSM, XERBLA
